[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657916560","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102817#issuecomment-2657916560","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102817","id":2657916560,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ebJaQ","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T23:25:48Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T23:25:48Z","body":"I've now got all the issues fixed in my testing!\r\n\r\nHowever, this does change quite a large amount of code, and will need a thorough review.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657916560/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659500068","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102817#issuecomment-2659500068","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102817","id":2659500068,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ehMAk","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T14:37:36Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T22:28:45Z","body":"After sleeping on this, I've decided to remove the explicit varargs support, and just treat Java varargs methods as having a final array parameter (which is contrary to what I [originally wrote here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102712#issuecomment-2652306347)).\r\n\r\nWhile implementing Java varargs as GDScript varargs makes for more idiomatic GDScript code, it creates problems with selecting the correct overridden method, since varargs in GDScript are untyped whereas in Java they are typed. This would make it impossible to distinguish between these two methods from GDScript:\r\n\r\n```kt\r\n        @JvmStatic\r\n        fun testMethod(int: Int, vararg args: String): String {\r\n            return \"String varargs: \" + args.contentToString()\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @JvmStatic\r\n        fun testMethod(int: Int, vararg args: Int): String {\r\n            return \"Int varargs: \" + args.contentToString()\r\n        }\r\n```\r\n\r\n... whereas, if we treat that final argument as a normal array, you can use either `Array[String]` or `Array[int]` in GDScript to target one or the other.\r\n\r\nSo, that's how it works now in my latest push! (I still have previous varargs approach in a branch, in case we want to go back to it.)\r\n\r\nThis also makes the PR much smaller and easier to review, perhaps making it more likely we could sneak it in for Godot 4.4?\r\n\r\ncc @m4gr3d @syntaxerror247 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659500068/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2689245183","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102817#issuecomment-2689245183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102817","id":2689245183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gSp__","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T22:26:19Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T22:26:19Z","body":"> The changes are small and scoped enough they should be safe to include in 4.4.\r\n\r\nThe ship _may_ have sailed on Godot 4.4, but it'd fine for this to end up in 4.4.1.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2689245183/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695284662","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102817#issuecomment-2695284662","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102817","id":2695284662,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gpse2","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T18:58:03Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T18:58:03Z","body":"In my latest push, I added one of the same efficiency improvements as I did in PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103375, where JNI fills some the arrays (the ones where the types match) rather than us going element by element. I have a test project that comprehensively tests all the conversion branches in this one, so I'm pretty confident about this update!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695284662/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701704845","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102817#issuecomment-2701704845","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102817","id":2701704845,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hCL6N","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T18:09:27Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T18:09:27Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701704845/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"pe